  },
  {
   "id": "lead-3",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "NewsFront describes itself as \"a news agency that runs news in ten languages including Russian, German, English, Bulgarian, Georgian, French, and Spanish.\"",
   "words": 22,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 3"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    22
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": true,
   "sanctioned_words": 22,
   "added_revision": 1252401206,
   "revisions": [
    1252401206
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    22
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": true,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 22,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "lead-4",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "The European Union's anti-disinformation unit EUvsDisinfo described NewsFront as a disinformation platform focused on Kremlin priorities.",
   "words": 18,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 3"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    18
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": true,
   "sanctioned_words": 18,
   "added_revision": 1252406177,
   "revisions": [
    1252406177
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    18
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": true,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 18,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "lead-5",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "They wrote: News Front latches on to any kind of discontent in each target audience, multiplies it and adds some content important to the Kremlin.",
   "words": 25,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 3"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    25
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": true,
   "sanctioned_words": 25,
   "added_revision": 1252406177,
   "revisions": [
    1252406177
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    25
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": true,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 25,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "lead-6",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "This way, the Kremlin hopes, Ukraine will be associated with whatever the German audiences hate – feminism, multi-culturalism, migration; while a British audience associate Ukraine with right-wing extremists, US imperialism and colonialism.",
   "words": 33,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 3"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    33
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": true,
   "sanctioned_words": 33,
   "added_revision": 1252406177,
