  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-5",
   "section": "Leadership and origin",
   "text": "As of 2022 as the owners of Mediagroup Newsfront LLC are listed Knyrik (50%) and Yulia Lozanova (50%), Lozanova is supposedly the wife of Sinelin.",
   "words": 25,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 2"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    25
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1104730683,
   "revisions": [
    1104730683
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    25
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-6",
   "section": "Leadership and origin",
   "text": "NewsFront was established in March 2014 when, during the Russian invasion of Crimea, Knyrik with a group of masked gunmen broke into the headquarters of the Crimean Center for Investigative Journalism and took over its resources.",
   "words": 36,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 8"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    34,
    2
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1075700620,
   "revisions": [
    1075700620,
    1075840084,
    1332576929
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    32,
    2,
    2
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-7",
   "section": "Leadership and origin",
   "text": "In April 2015, the Media Group News Front company registered NewsFront.info as a private news agency.",
   "words": 17,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    17
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1075879803,
   "revisions": [
    1075879803
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    17
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-8",
   "section": "Leadership and origin",
   "text": "In 2018, Knyrik told an interviewer that his goal was \"an alternative source of information for people in Europe and the U.S.\" to counteract \"this bullshit published by the mainstream media in the West.\"",
   "words": 35,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    35
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1075877813,
   "revisions": [
    1075877813
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    35
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-9",
   "section": "Leadership and origin",
   "text": "With NewsFront, he claimed that he was fighting an \"information war\" that had been started by Western nations unfairly attacking Russia.",
   "words": 21,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 6"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    18,
    3
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1075877813,
   "revisions": [
    1075877813,
    1076156528
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    18,
    3
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-10",
   "section": "Leadership and origin",
   "text": "Knyrik has been sanctioned by Ukraine in 2020, followed by the European Union, United States, Australia and Switzerland in 2022.",
   "words": 20,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 2"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    20
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1104730683,
   "revisions": [
    1104730683
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    20
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-11",
   "section": "Leadership and origin",
   "text": "Sinelin has been sanctioned by the United States, Ukraine and Australia in 2022.",
   "words": 13,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 2"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    13
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1104730683,
   "revisions": [
    1104730683
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    13
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-12",
   "section": "Leadership and origin",
   "text": "Mediagroup Newsfront LLC has been sanctioned by the United States in 2021, followed by Ukraine, Australia and Japan in 2022.",
   "words": 20,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 2"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    20
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1104730683,
   "revisions": [
    1104730683
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    20
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-1",
   "section": "Allegations of disinformation",
   "text": "In 2017, German newspaper Die Zeit alleged that NewsFront had tried to influence elections in both Germany and France by promoting false claims against Angela Merkel and Emmanuel Macron.",
   "words": 29,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    29
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1075700620,
   "revisions": [
    1075700620,
    1075840579
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    21,
    8
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-2",
   "section": "Allegations of disinformation",
   "text": "According to the Atlantic Council, NewsFront was in 2017 one of the top three sources of Russian propaganda in Germany.",
   "words": 20,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    20
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1079493250,
   "revisions": [
    1079493250
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    20
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-3",
   "section": "Allegations of disinformation",
   "text": "Together with official Russian outlets RT and Sputnik, their content had 500,000 followers on Facebook.",
   "words": 16,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 3"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    14,
    2
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": true,
   "sanctioned_words": 2,
   "added_revision": 1079493250,
   "revisions": [
    1079493250,
    1252407947
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    14,
    2
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": true,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 2,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-4",
   "section": "Allegations of disinformation",
   "text": "In 2019, EU vs Disinformation stated that NewsFront focuses its German-language version on anti-immigration German nationalism in order to attract a discontented German-speaking audience to the pro-Kremlin viewpoints of news from RT and Sputnik.",
   "words": 38,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    38
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1078531685,
   "revisions": [
    1078531685
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    38
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-5",
   "section": "Allegations of disinformation",
   "text": "The English language version pursues the same goal, but with \"left-leaning\" commentary, nothing about immigration.",
   "words": 16,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    16
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1078531685,
   "revisions": [
    1078531685
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    16
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-6",
   "section": "Allegations of disinformation",
   "text": "According to EU vs Disinformation, NewsFront published more than 800 disinformations since 2015 (as of July 2022).",
   "words": 17,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 2"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    17
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1104730683,
   "revisions": [
    1104730683
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    17
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-7",
   "section": "Allegations of disinformation",
   "text": "In 2020, the US State Department described NewsFront as part of a \"disinformation and propaganda ecosystem,\" where Russian state actors teamed with others whose connection to Russia was less clear, in order to get wide attention for their ideas.",
   "words": 39,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    39
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1075700620,
   "revisions": [
    1075700620
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    39
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-8",
   "section": "Allegations of disinformation",
   "text": "In 2021, a State Department official speaking on the basis of classified information told The Wall Street Journal that NewsFront \"is guided by the FSB,\" Russia's successor agency to the Soviet Union's KGB.",
   "words": 35,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    35
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1075700620,
   "revisions": [
    1075700620
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    35
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-9",
   "section": "Allegations of disinformation",
   "text": "Time magazine in 2021 described NewsFront as \"by far the most successful and ambitious\" Russia-led website making false claims about COVID-19 and vaccines.",
   "words": 25,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 9"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    24,
    1
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1075886364,
   "revisions": [
    1075886364,
    1076264706,
    1076815743
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    23,
    1,
    1
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-10",
   "section": "Allegations of disinformation",
   "text": "For example, NewsFront published claims that the U.S. government created coronavirus and intentionally exported it to China.",
   "words": 18,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    18
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1076263466,
   "revisions": [
    1076263466,
    1076265883,
    1076264706
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    13,
    4,
    1
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-11",
   "section": "Allegations of disinformation",
   "text": "In 2021 and again in 2022, the US Treasury announced sanctions against NewsFront, calling it in 2022 \"a Crimea-based disinformation and propaganda outlet...particularly focused on supporting Russia-backed forces in Ukraine.\"",
   "words": 33,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    33
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1075700620,
   "revisions": [
    1075700620
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    33
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-12",
   "section": "Allegations of disinformation",
   "text": "In February 2024 they spread stories of a supposedly upcoming biopic of President Zelenskyy of Ukraine called “The Price of Victory”.",
   "words": 21,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 4",
    "Editor 5"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    17,
    4
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1212399822,
   "revisions": [
    1212399822,
    1379145750,
    1379145153
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    17,
    3,
    1
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-13",
   "section": "Allegations of disinformation",
   "text": "They included videos of the actors Chuck Norris and Dolph Lundgren manipulated to appear to be wishing him success with the film.",
   "words": 22,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 4"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    22
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1212399822,
   "revisions": [
    1212399822
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    22
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec3-1",
   "section": "Social media",
   "text": "In April 2020, according to NBC News, Facebook and Twitter deleted many pages and accounts they said were linked to \"Coordinated Inauthentic Behavior\" by Russian actors, including those linked to NewsFront and to SouthFront.",
   "words": 34,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 3"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    33,
    1
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": true,
   "sanctioned_words": 1,
   "added_revision": 1076399788,
   "revisions": [
    1076399788,
    1075700620,
    1075702396,
    1076261287,
    1076235431,
    1076397872,
    1252410049
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    21,
    6,
    2,
    2,
    1,
    1,
    1
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": true,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 1,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec3-2",
   "section": "Social media",
   "text": "In May 2020, NewsFront was blocked on YouTube due to a violation of YouTube's Terms of Use.",
   "words": 18,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 2"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    18
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1104730683,
   "revisions": [
    1104730683
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    18
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec3-3",
   "section": "Social media",
   "text": "In February 2022, Facebook again took action against NewsFront and SouthFront, for further activity violating their policies.",
   "words": 17,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    17
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1076399788,
   "revisions": [
    1076399788
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    17
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec3-4",
   "section": "Social media",
   "text": "According to the German Marshall Fund, the new violations involved fake profiles that helped evade the bans by posting links to mirror sites, where innocuous URLs showed content identical to that in NewsFront.",
   "words": 35,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 3",
    "Editor 7"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    31,
    2,
    2
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": true,
   "sanctioned_words": 2,
   "added_revision": 1076261287,
   "revisions": [
    1076261287,
    1076346066,
    1076399788,
    1078396664,
    1252410617
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    21,
    5,
    5,
    2,
    2
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": true,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 2,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec3-5",
   "section": "Social media",
   "text": "In addition to mirror sites, they also used cloaking sites, that is, URLs that re-directed a browser to URLs at NewsFront.",
   "words": 22,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    22
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1076346066,
   "revisions": [
    1076346066,
